Describe what PersonCard is for, and when to reach for something else.

## Visual Contract

<Page>
  <Component name="PersonCard" status="draft"
    layoutMode="VERTICAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
    primaryAxisAlignItems="MIN" counterAxisAlignItems="MIN"
    paddingLeft={16} paddingRight={16} paddingTop={16} paddingBottom={16} cornerRadius={6}
    fills={[{ type: 'SOLID', color: '{color#surface-raised}' }]}
    itemSpacing="{space#xs}">
    <Text name="name" characters="{item.name}" fontSize="{type#lg}" fills={[{ opacity: 1, visible: true, type: 'SOLID', color: '{color#text}' }]} />
    <Text
      name="role"
      characters="{item.role}"
      textAutoResize="WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT"
      fills={[{ opacity: 1, visible: true, type: 'SOLID', color: '{color#accent}' }]}
      fontSize="{type#sm}"
    />
  </Component>
</Page>

## Contract

<Props>
  <Prop name="item" type="Person">Describe the prop "item".</Prop>
</Props>
